Binaries/
Build/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Saved/
PackagedBuilds/

# Binary assets not tracked via Git LFS
Content/Collections/
Content/Developers/
Content/*.uasset
# Mesh/skeleton/anim sources — pulled from engine plugins, not committed.
# (Recursive: a bare Content/*.uasset above only matches Content/'s direct
# children, so this leaked into git+LFS once before — see commit history.)
#
# Written as /** rather than a bare directory on purpose: an excluded DIRECTORY
# is never descended into, so any !negation inside it is dead. Excluding the
# CONTENTS keeps the directory traversable and lets the exceptions below work.
Content/Characters/**
# ...EXCEPT the handful of project-authored assets the game cannot run without.
# Everything above is re-derivable from the engine's MoverExamples plugin; these
# are not, and CI has no other source for them. Without them an Android build
# silently ships a game whose players neither animate nor render correctly:
#   - ABP_VolleyballPlayer is the Animation Blueprint SetupMesh() loads by path.
#     When the load fails the code falls back to the raw anim instance, which has
#     no AnimGraph — so nothing blends and none of the IK runs. That is the
#     "arms and legs don't move at all" report from the Play build.
#   - IK_Mannequin is the IK Rig whose goals that AnimGraph drives.
#   - MI_Manny_0*_New are the material instances that own the "Paint Tint"
#     parameter ApplyTeamMaterial() sets. The MoverExamples fallback materials
#     call the same slot "Tint", so the tint silently no-ops there and the
#     bodies render black — the "textures don't work" half of the same report.
# They total ~3MB, versus ~126MB for the Mannequins mesh/anim library that
# exhausted the LFS budget. Kept OUT of LFS deliberately (see .gitattributes).
!Content/Characters/Mannequin/
!Content/Characters/Mannequin/**
!Content/Characters/Mannequins/
!Content/Characters/Mannequins/Rigs/
!Content/Characters/Mannequins/Rigs/IK_Mannequin.uasset
!Content/Characters/Mannequins/Materials/
!Content/Characters/Mannequins/Materials/Manny/
!Content/Characters/Mannequins/Materials/Manny/MI_Manny_0*_New.uasset
# Level maps — CourtLevel.umap is tracked, others are not
Content/*.umap
!Content/CourtLevel.umap

# IDE and compiler artifacts
*.VC.db
*.opensdf
*.opendb
*.sdf
*.suo
*.sln
*.xcworkspace
*.xcodeproj
Config/DefaultEditor.ini
Script/Binds.Cache*

# Android signing material — never committed. NOTE: Config/Android/AndroidEngine.ini
# itself IS tracked (it also carries the mobile SkyAtmosphere override from
# c4b3094) — CI appends the signing block to it rather than overwriting it.
# (Build/ above already covers Build/Android/*.keystore; these are belt-and-suspenders.)
*.keystore
*.jks

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc
